---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "关于";

const hobbis = ["阅读","散步","看日落","看展看剧","最爱嫖姚和宝哥"];
---
<BaseLayout title={pageTitle}><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h1>关于我</h1></header><div class="prose">
	<h2>Intro</h2>
	<p>SJTU机械工程大三在读。喜欢码字、喜欢分享、喜欢尝试，故。</p>
	<p>在真空中飞翔的哲学家。</p>
	<h2>Goals</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>学习德语</li>
		<li>拎着吉他去政大</li>
		<li>给Elon Musk干活</li>
		<li>学习一点区块链及金融知识</li>
		<li>时代留忆：我们这一代（参考肖全作品集）</li>
		<li>2027 献给旅行者一号的故事</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Achives</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://camilliablog.netlify.app/">搭建博客</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://liaoxuefeng.com/books/python/introduction/index.html">学习Python</a></li> 
	</ul>
	<h2>Hobbis</h2>
	<ul>{hobbis.map((hobby) => <li class="hobby">{hobby}</li>)}</ul>
</div></BaseLayout>
